sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant MainOrchestrator
    participant ModellPipeline
    participant OpenAIAPIClient
    participant PromptTemplates

    User->>MainOrchestrator: Provide Review
    MainOrchestrator->>ModellPipeline: Invoke Pipeline
    ModellPipeline->>PromptTemplates: Fetch System and User Prompts
    PromptTemplates-->>ModellPipeline: Return Prompts

    ModellPipeline->>OpenAIAPIClient: Parse Review + Prompts (Step 1: Extract Aspect Categories)
    OpenAIAPIClient-->>ModellPipeline: Return Extracted Aspect Categories

    ModellPipeline->>OpenAIAPIClient: Parse Aspect Categories + Prompts (Step 2: Extract Sentiments)
    OpenAIAPIClient-->>ModellPipeline: Return Extracted Sentiments

    ModellPipeline->>OpenAIAPIClient: Parse Sentiments + Prompts (Step 3: Extract Justifications)
    OpenAIAPIClient-->>ModellPipeline: Return Justifications

    ModellPipeline-->>MainOrchestrator: Return Final Results
    MainOrchestrator-->>User: Provide Final Output